context:
GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/members/{member_id}
Get information about a specific member of an account.
Required: member_id (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/members/{member_id}
Remove a member from an account.
Required: member_id (path); account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/members/{member_id}
Modify an account member.
Required: member_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)
